cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PageVet or its published measurements, please cite it as below."
title: "PageVet: find text in web pages aimed at AI models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zulick
    given-names: Joseph
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/j-zulick/pagevet"
url: "https://j-zulick.github.io/pagevet/"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic scanner for indirect prompt injection in web pages: text aimed at AI models in visible text,
  hidden elements, comments, attributes, structured data, images, headers and llms.txt, with severity, advice,
  OWASP and MITRE ATLAS IDs, and an AI-crawler access check. Every published number comes with its data, script
  and date.
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - AI security
  - LLM
  - AI crawlers
  - SARIF
